d $115 million to repurchase its own shares and $320 million in dividends: $435 million together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["SWKS.buybacks.2026","SWKS.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-02 revenue was $1 billion (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), down 5% from $1.1 billion in the three months ended 2025-10-03.","cites":["SWKS.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-10-02","SWKS.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.revenue.2024-09-28.2025-10-03","SWKS.d.revenue.2024-09-28.2025-06-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-02 revenue added up to $4 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $217 million and net income to $172 million.","cites":["SWKS.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SWKS.d.revenue.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","SWKS.d.revenue.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-10-02","SWKS.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.opinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SWKS.d.opinc.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","SWKS.d.opinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.opinc.2025-10-04.2026-10-02","SWKS.d.opinc.2025-10-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.netinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SWKS.d.netinc.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","SWKS.d.netinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.netinc.2025-10-04.2026-10-02","SWKS.d.netinc.2025-10-04.2026-07-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $229 million: operating cash flow of $550 million less capital spending of $321 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["SWKS.d.ocf.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SWKS.d.ocf.2025-10-04.2026-04-03","SWKS.d.ocf.2025-10-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.ocf.2025-10-04.2026-10-02","SWKS.d.capex.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SWKS.d.capex.2025-10-04.2026-04-03","SWKS.d.capex.2025-10-04.2026-07-03","SWKS.d.capex.2025-10-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $4.4 million in total and -$4.2 million actually paid.","cites":["SWKS.pay.neoTotal.2025","SWKS.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $59.29 at the end of FY2025, and $586.00 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["SWKS.pay.tsr.2025","SWKS.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 10,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $396,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["SWKS.q.employees","SWKS.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $124 million, after $24.2 million in FY2025.","cites":["SWKS.restructuring.2026","SWKS.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $2.6 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $0 in short-term investments, and $2.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebt). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $133 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["SWKS.cash.2026","SWKS.sti.2026","SWKS.debtTotal.2026"]}]},"fin":{"SWKS":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":27,"read":27,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[],"rows":[]},"risks":{"compared":true,"prior":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","threshold":0.5,"counts":{"now":35,"before":35,"same":28,"reworded":3,"elsewhere":0,"new":4,"removed":4},"new":["SWKS.q.risk.0","SWKS.q.risk.1","SWKS.q.risk.2","SWKS.q.risk.3"],"removed":["SWKS.q.riskgone.0","SWKS.q.riskgone.1","SWKS.q.riskgone.2","SWKS.q.riskgone.3"],"reworded":[["SWKS.q.riskrw.0","SWKS.q.riskrwwas.0",0.52],["SWKS.q.riskrw.1","SWKS.q.riskrwwas.1",0.62],["SWKS.q.riskrw.2","SWKS.q.riskrwwas.2",0.66]]}}},"quotes":{"SWKS.q.employees":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"employees","n":10000,"quote":"As of October 2, 2026, our workforce consists of approximately 10,000 employees located around the world, more than 99% of whom are full-time employees.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"ab143813ab6e132e48cd2aa8f406eee23c4dbdc9a387ad971acab389a9b50f5c"},"SWKS.q.risk.0":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"We face risks of a loss of revenue if contracts with the U.S. government or defense and aerospace contractors are canceled or delayed or if defense spending is reduced.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"c777470c0abf1c00a4c09edf06215fbd50f6411481a258b220a11298e8869b85"},"SWKS.q.risk.1":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"Imbalances in the supply of memory, storage and other components could increase our costs or our customers’ costs and product prices, which could reduce demand for our products.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"e59716dddd45991c132626eaf58da86144b11e6845773477981be2cfac3930aa"},"SWKS.q.risk.2":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"We may not be able to effectively execute restructuring initiatives, which could result in total costs that are greater than expected and cause us not to achieve the expected long-term operational benefits of such initiatives.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"a11bd67dd8d34016eb31cc9c40c3ee2d0652f76ae2f04191560348fc4a2d3a38"},"SWKS.q.risk.3":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"Our acquisition of Qorvo will result in significant goodwill and acquired intangible assets, and changes in operating performance, market conditions, integration plans, product roadmaps or valuation assumptions could result in material impairment charges.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"fc99b3ccfc8ab026b8e4e77687b32f4bea1a14d85f9deefb7847d11c7c600bbc"},"SWKS.q.riskgone.0":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Completion of the proposed transaction with Qorvo may be delayed or not occur at all for a variety of reasons, including that the Merger Agreement is terminated, and the failure to complete the Mergers could adversely affect our business, results of operations, financial condition, and the market price of our common stock.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"97098951a5c1b98913c150006eaba980c658a5df593bb617280885718b119afe"},"SWKS.q.riskgone.1":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The Merger Agreement contains provisions that limit our ability to pursue alternative transactions to the Mergers which could discourage a potential third party from making an alternative transaction proposal.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"6a525de2f67092d144e891e7ee7256ae00ca83b4d425e0d80b7ad064aae4b518"},"SWKS.q.riskgone.2":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If our senior management transitions are not successful, our business and future growth prospects could be harmed.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"46922c0a10e6370aa51d552314e5a7552481fd5f69c8cda5ffa221056eaa03e3"},"SWKS.q.riskgone.3":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may encounter problems upgrading, enhancing, and improving our enterprise applications.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"ada3d89f533c4cf11550f1f7e9207f0ecfe62e270660a94447aa3b956abb680b"},"SWKS.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"We are dependent upon third parties for the manufacture, assembly, and testing of our products.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"bdaf311c6dea5ac5221b498c155f3ce8a9a9b55e8949a912a4947bad452e5573"},"SWKS.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We are dependent upon third parties for the supply of raw materials and components.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"580550abc0c8e5896f46ded2a6a9eb34d8cab2d7b3e4490a6404d9ed93b555c0"},"SWKS.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"We may not be able to successfully protect our intellectual property rights.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"ed030860570285535ff1abe0b319e6a8fbc18a0097c9b94968e62f15120fce48"},"SWKS.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"In order to remain competitive, we must be able to successfully protect our intellectual property rights.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"02141e2ef2e98178a2eff2bc5632628bf73a68c1755d8589e14d46f02f7e5b05"},"SWKS.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk","quote":"Efforts to integrate Qorvo could disrupt our relationships with third parties and employees and divert management’s attention, which could adversely impact our operating results and ongoing business.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-26-000055","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-11-10","proof":"8b4bf748fa252b9d1f44f8471a2620d1b7b7f811afab5950d8cbbf9138c052c9"},"SWKS.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"SWKS","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Efforts to complete the Mergers could disrupt our relationships with third parties and employees, divert management’s attention, or result in negative publicity or legal proceedings, any of which could adversely impact our operating results and ongoing business.","source":"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-11-07","proof":"ff22a05565e235eec0470720593d2f1bb1132098a6ce92d92b0995b7ca4361b8"}},"sources":{"SWKS-0000004127-25-000085":{"kind":"prior-annual-report","by":"SWKS","form":"10-K","period":"2025-10-03","date":"2025-11-07","accn":"0000004127-25-000085","title":"Skyworks 10-K for the fiscal year ended 2025-10-03","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/4127/000000412725000085/swks-20251003.htm","sha":"99b8dc973b9a86a71003d44d5daff86450482e496ef4d1b0db601b4f84820199"}}}